  m_text: "Welcome to Bobatorium's first playtest build!\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n- Click
    and drag cups to  place them in machines.\n- Click and drag on red buttons/levers
    to activate machines.\n- Right click on a machine to upgrade it.\n- Place cups
    on the delivery tray and press the button. If the cup is complete, it will be
    sold.\n\n- Click the arrow in the corner to go to the break room. You can purchase
    employees there. \n- Click and drag employees onto a machine to put them to work.
    \n- If an employee gets sleepy, place them in a chair to let them rest."
